        "pl-extract.jsonl": [
            {
                "entry_id": "9b211e1b-28bf-3f44-8dc4-3c0a6cd6e039",
                "word": "ideowy",
                "pos": "adj",
                "lang_code": "pl",
                "forms": [],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "51861348-ba94-3109-be0d-03389ab29137",
                        "entry_id": "9b211e1b-28bf-3f44-8dc4-3c0a6cd6e039",
                        "glosses": [
                            "związany z pewną ideą, ideologią"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [],
                        "sense_index_json": "\"1.1\""
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "6188f64f-09e4-3dbb-b209-4768a6ca52eb",
                        "entry_id": "9b211e1b-28bf-3f44-8dc4-3c0a6cd6e039",
                        "glosses": [
                            "oddany określonej idei"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [],
                        "sense_index_json": "\"1.2\""
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "8beda7ab-3012-4daa-84aa-1ab4a9a30ee7",
                        "source_entry_id": "9b211e1b-28bf-3f44-8dc4-3c0a6cd6e039",
                        "source_sense_id": "51861348-ba94-3109-be0d-03389ab29137",
                        "target_lang_word": "ideological",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "ideological",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "eb761f4b-8200-35df-94c5-aa9de001e5b4",
                                        "entry_id": "12daccd2-6b6d-37ce-922b-33a4dc09fd53",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Of or pertaining to one or more ideologies."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "462c4a70-791a-4608-bf22-0dfcaa3571d5",
                                                "sense_id": "eb761f4b-8200-35df-94c5-aa9de001e5b4",
                                                "text": "There are economists from all over the ideological spectrum."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8da27c7f-b30f-44f2-a12e-048f27720e58",
                                                "sense_id": "eb761f4b-8200-35df-94c5-aa9de001e5b4",
                                                "text": "ideological fervor"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "01f80980-88f2-4f0a-afd1-09c2472f54c1",
                                                "sense_id": "eb761f4b-8200-35df-94c5-aa9de001e5b4",
                                                "text": "Given these entrenched ideological assumptions about the colonial order, it is no wonder that the state and those groups with an interest in the status quo viewed with suspicion and hostility any challenges to the fixed and \"natural\" boundaries between different sorts of people."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d939cec1-88a4-40c7-879d-9b2945a2b009",
                                                "sense_id": "eb761f4b-8200-35df-94c5-aa9de001e5b4",
                                                "text": "She also noted that the administration, in a letter in April, “specifically conditioned funding on agreeing to its ten terms, only one of which related to antisemitism, while six related to ideological and pedagogical concerns, including who may lead and teach at Harvard, who may be admitted, and what may be taught.”"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "3713c7b7-7b5d-3593-8a0f-0fe9657e702f",
                                        "entry_id": "12daccd2-6b6d-37ce-922b-33a4dc09fd53",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Irrational; supported by misinformation and social reinforcement, as opposed to credible evidence."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "of a claim or idea"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b42f90e9-0009-32dd-a314-729cf6b2b3b9",
                                        "entry_id": "12daccd2-6b6d-37ce-922b-33a4dc09fd53",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Characterized by strict, uncompromising adherence to a particular political ideology, rather than what’s necessarily considered popular or practical."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "bb4157ed-90d8-456e-a9d3-bc8c0888264a",
                                                "sense_id": "b42f90e9-0009-32dd-a314-729cf6b2b3b9",
                                                "text": "The most ruthless leaders in history were often ideological ones with utopian visions."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9971098f-858d-4310-95d3-4309a5a8c62c",
                                                "sense_id": "b42f90e9-0009-32dd-a314-729cf6b2b3b9",
                                                "text": "The regime, ideological in governance, continued its socialist agenda despite market backlash."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1dc4156d-fb9a-4473-a58a-f1b4cf0d43e5",
                                                "sense_id": "b42f90e9-0009-32dd-a314-729cf6b2b3b9",
                                                "text": "ideological trade policy"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "320b2df5-42f1-4eb6-9e6f-07420106a4cf",
                        "source_entry_id": "9b211e1b-28bf-3f44-8dc4-3c0a6cd6e039",
                        "source_sense_id": "51861348-ba94-3109-be0d-03389ab29137",
                        "target_lang_word": "idéologique",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "idéologique",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "f11b5213-6aa9-326e-8ddb-fed7aaa91b3b",
                                        "entry_id": "620ae577-e5e0-3744-babe-7458d0e7872b",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Qui a rapport à l’idéologie."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a84f780e-5856-408f-8cb5-5ad695251045",
                                                "sense_id": "f11b5213-6aa9-326e-8ddb-fed7aaa91b3b",
                                                "text": "Toutes les parties idéologiques des traités locarniens sont tombées l'une après l'autre. Et le résidu constitue l'alliance."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "35a12633-9db9-4fce-8670-bce03ea4eb1b",
                                                "sense_id": "f11b5213-6aa9-326e-8ddb-fed7aaa91b3b",
                                                "text": "Parce qu'elle est mutilation psychologique, et s'accompagne généralement de pratiques mortificatoires, l’adhésion idéologique doit être considéeée comme un état morbide, même si elle est socialement acceptée, devenant par là psychose socialisée."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "55eec1a6-cd67-42de-8c62-4ff0aa2aa99a",
                                                "sense_id": "f11b5213-6aa9-326e-8ddb-fed7aaa91b3b",
                                                "text": "Par-delà les débats idéologiques, on a déjà pointé les dérives potentielles d’une société ultra-gérée (de Gaulejac, 2005) dans laquelle la production se réoriente en fonction d’indicateurs et d’objectifs de plus en plus souvent détachés de la réalité, tandis que le non-mesurable tend à être négligé."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "bf3c1a68-36f2-4b1e-9369-9d553bdef800",
                                                "sense_id": "f11b5213-6aa9-326e-8ddb-fed7aaa91b3b",
                                                "text": "\"La demande d’expérience professionnelle pour des métiers en pénurie, c’est un discours complètement idéologique. Cela met le focus sur les demandeurs d’emploi qui ne veulent pas travailler et sur le fait que les employeurs n’engagent pas."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "51d5fa54-1b30-427a-a770-d1f7ee6093bc",
                                                "sense_id": "f11b5213-6aa9-326e-8ddb-fed7aaa91b3b",
                                                "text": "Il nous faudra aussi comprendre qu'être berdache dans une société à prédominance masculine ne peut être la même chose qu'être transgenre dans une société passée en mode idéologique matricentré."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "b11042d5-bd61-47ed-81a4-2667bf097404",
                        "source_entry_id": "9b211e1b-28bf-3f44-8dc4-3c0a6cd6e039",
